    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You have spent so much time on the battlefield that patching up wounded allies has become second nature to you.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can perform <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surgery\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surgery\">Surgery</a> on a number of creatures equal to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> modifier (minimum 2) simultaneously. You make <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> checks for each individual creature as normal.</p>",
